Package: quartowp
Title: Publish Quarto Articles to WordPress
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Peter",
      family = "Baumgartner",
      email = "petzi53@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Render Quarto articles and publish their text, tables, and
    figures to WordPress through the WordPress REST API. The package uploads
    locally generated media, rewrites media references, and creates or
    updates WordPress posts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/petzi53/quartowp
